">YOUR STORE, ORGANIZED</div><h1 id=\"pageTitle\">Inventory overview</h1><p id=\"pageSubtitle\">A clear view of your merchandise and the details that need attention.</p></div><button class=\"primary\" id=\"inspectTop\"><span>↥</span> Inspect a CSV</button></div>\n<div class=\"notice\"><span>◉</span><p><b>You’re viewing demonstration data.</b> Explore the workspace with synthetic non-weapon merchandise. CSV previews stay in this browser tab.</p><span class=\"tag soft\">PREVIEW</span></div>\n<section id=\"summary\" class=\"metrics\" aria-label=\"Inventory summary\"></section>\n<section id=\"catalogSection\"><div class=\"sectionHead\"><div><h2 id=\"catalogTitle\">Merchandise inventory</h2><p>Browse items, check details, and review data quality.</p></div><span class=\"muted\">Source: synthetic sample</span></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"toolbar\"><label class=\"search\"><span>⌕</span><input id=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search items, identifiers or brands\" aria-label=\"Search merchandise\"></label><label class=\"selectLabel\">Category<select id=\"category\"><option value=\"\">All categories</option></select></label><label class=\"selectLabel\">Availability<select id=\"stock\"><option value=\"\">All availability</option><option value=\"in\">In stock</option><option value=\"out\">Out of stock</option></select></label><label class=\"selectLabel\">Images<select id=\"imageFilter\"><option value=\"\">All image states</option><option value=\"present\">Image available</option><option value=\"missing\">Missing image</option></select></label><button class=\"subtle\" id=\"clear\">Reset</button></div>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th><button data-sort=\"name\">ITEM <span>↕</span></button></th><th><button data-sort=\"sku\">IDENTIFIER <span>↕</span></button></th><th><button data-sort=\"category\">CATEGORY <span>↕</span></button></th><th><button data-sort=\"quantity\">QUANTITY <span>↕</span></button></th><th>IMAGE</th><th>DATA QUALITY</th><th><span class=\"sr\">Details</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table><div id=\"empty\" class=\"empty\" hidden><div>⌕</div><h3>No matching items</h3><p>Try a different search or clear your filters.</p><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"emptyClear\">Clear filters</button></div></div>\n<footer class=\"pagination\"><span id=\"results\" role=\"status\"></span><label>Rows per page <select id=\"pageSize\"><option>8</option><option>16</option><option>24</option></select></label><div><button id=\"previous\" aria-label=\"Previous page\">←</button><span id=\"pageNumber\"></span><button id=\"next\" aria-label=\"Next page\">→</button></div></footer></div>\n<div class=\"bottomGrid\"><section class=\"panel compact\"><div class=\"sectionHead\"><h2>Recent activity</h2><span class=\"tag soft\">DEMO</span></div><div class=\"activity\"><span class=\"activityIcon\">↥</span><div><b>Demonstration inventory loaded</b><p id=\"activityCount\"></p></div><small>This session</small></div><div class=\"activity\"><span class=\"activityIcon pink\">◇</span><div><b>Quality checks completed</b><p>Identifiers, required fields and image states reviewed.</p></div><small>This session</small></div></section><section class=\"panel compact\"><div class=\"sectionHead\"><h2>Image completeness</h2><span id=\"imagePercent\" class=\"largeNumber\"></span></div><div class=\"progress\"><span id=\"imageProgress\"></span></div><p class=\"muted\" id=\"imageNote\"></p><button class=\"textButton\" data-view=\"images\">Review image library →</button></section></div></section>\n<section id=\"importsSection\" hidden><div class=\"importGrid\"><div class=\"panel compact\"><span class=\"step\">01 / SELECT A FILE</span><h2>Inspect a local CSV</h2><p class=\"muted\">Check structure and map columns before any future import. This preview never saves inventory.</p><label class=\"dropzone\" for=\"csvFile\"><span>↥</span><b>Choose a CSV file</b><small>UTF-8 or Windows-1252 · up to 1 MiB / 200 records</small></label><input type=\"file\" id=\"csvFile\" accept=\".csv,text/csv\"><label class=\"field\">Text encoding<select id=\"encoding\"><option value=\"utf-8\">UTF-8</option><option value=\"windows-1252\">Windows-1252</option></select></label><div id=\"fileStatus\" class=\"fileStatus\" role=\"status\">No file selected.</div><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"sampleCsv\">Load synthetic CSV sample</button></div><div class=\"panel compact\"><span class=\"step\">02 / MAP & VALIDATE</span><h2>Column mapping</h2><p class=\"muted\">Original cells stay unchanged. Repeated identifiers are flagged, never combined.</p><div id=\"mappingEmpty\" class=\"empty small\"><div>▤</div><p>Select a file to view its columns.</p></div><div id=\"mapping\" hidden><label class=\"field\">Identifier column<select id=\"mapId\"></select></label><label class=\"field\">Name column<select id=\"mapName\"></select></label><label class=\"field\">Image URL column (optional)<select id=\"mapImage\"></select></label><button class=\"primary\" id=\"validate\">Validate preview</button></div></div></div><section class=\"panel compact\" id=\"validationPanel\"><div class=\"sectionHead\"><h2>Validation results</h2><span class=\"tag neutral\" id=\"validationTag\">AWAITING FILE</span></div><div id=\"validationResult\" class=\"empty small\"><p>Results will appear here. Nothing is sent to a server.</p></div><div class=\"tablewrap\" id=\"csvPreview\"></div></section><section class=\"panel compact\"><div class=\"sectionHead\"><h2>Inspection history</h2><span class=\"muted\">Current tab only</span></div><div id=\"history\"><p class=\"muted\">No CSV inspections yet.</p></div></section></section>\n<section id=\"imagesSection\" hidden><div class=\"sectionHead\"><div><h2>Merchandise image library</h2><p>Sample illustrations and honest missing-image states.</p></div><span class=\"tag neutral\">NO AUTOMATIC DOWNLOADS</span></div><div class=\"panel compact\"><h2>Inspect an image URL</h2><p class=\"muted\">Only reviewed HTTPS hosts are allowed. External images load only after a separate confirmation click.</p><label class=\"field\">Image URL<input id=\"imageUrl\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://images.unsplash.com/…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"previewImage\">Preview URL</button><div id=\"externalImagePreview\" class=\"externalPreview\"></div></div><div id=\"imageGrid\" class=\"imageGrid\"></div></section>\n<section id=\"qualitySection\" hidden><div class=\"sectionHead\"><div><h2>Details worth a second look</h2><p>Review warnings without changing or removing records.</p></div><span class=\"tag warning\">SYNTHETIC CHECKS</span></div><div id=\"qualityList\" class=\"qualityList\"></div></section>\n<footer class=\"workspaceFooter\"><span>Pink Elephant · Inventory workspace</span><span>Preview only. No store records are changed.</span></footer></div></main>\n<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"overlay\" hidden></div><section class=\"drawer\" id=\"detail\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"detailTitle\" hidden tabindex=\"-1\"><header><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">ITEM DETAILS</span><h2 id=\"detailTitle\"></h2></div><button id=\"closeDetail\" class=\"iconButton\" aria-label=\"Close item details\">✕</button></header><div id=\"detailBody\"></div></section><script nonce=\"PE_WORKSPACE_NONCE_PLACEHOLDER\" type=\"module\">const workspaceAssets={\"assets/bag-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/bag.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/books-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/books.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/camera-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/camera.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/guitar-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/guitar.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/headphones-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/headphones.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/keyboard-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/keyboard.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/speaker-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/speaker.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/watch-detail.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",\"assets/watch.svg\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\"};\n// Local-file inspection only. No database, supplier client or network dependency.\nconst limits=Object.freeze({bytes:1024*1024,rows:200,columns:200,cell:65536});\nclass CsvPreviewError extends Error {\n  constructor(code){super('CSV preview rejected: '+code);this.name='CsvPreviewError';this.code=code;}\n}\nconst reject=code=>{throw new CsvPreviewError(code);};\n\n// Strict, bounded CSV for owner-provided small samples; never reads a full feed.\nfunction parseCsvSample(buffer){\n  if(!(buffer instanceof Uint8Array)||buffer.byteLength>limits.bytes)reject('file_limit');\n  let text;try{text=new TextDecoder('utf-8',{fatal:true}).decode(buffer);}catch{reject('encoding');}\n  if(text.includes('\\0'))reject('encoding');\n  text=text.replace(/^\\uFEFF/,'');\n  const rows=[];let row=[],cell='',state='start',ended=false;\n  const addChar=c=>{cell+=c;if(cell.length>limits.cell)reject('cell_limit');};\n  const field=()=>{row.push(cell);cell='';if(row.length>limits.columns)reject('column_limit');state='start';};\n  const record=()=>{field();rows.push(row);row=[];if(rows.length>limits.rows+1)reject('row_limit');};\n  for(let i=0;i<text.length;i++){\n    const c=text[i];ended=false;\n    if(state==='quoted'){\n      if(c==='\"'){if(text[i+1]==='\"'){addChar('\"');i++;}else state='closed';}\n      else addChar(c);\n      continue;\n    }\n    if(c===','){field();continue;}\n    if(c==='\\r'||c==='\\n'){if(c==='\\r'&&text[i+1]==='\\n')i++;record();ended=true;continue;}\n    if(state==='closed')reject('quote_syntax');\n    if(c==='\"'){if(state!=='start')reject('quote_syntax');state='quoted';}\n    else {state='unquoted';addChar(c);}\n  }\n  if(state==='quoted')reject('quote_syntax');\n  if(text&&!ended)record();\n  if(!rows.length)reject('empty_file');\n  const headers=rows.shift().map(h=>h.trim());\n  if(headers.some(h=>!h||h.length>128||/[\\r\\n\\x00-\\x1f]/.test(h))||new Set(headers).size!==headers.length)reject('headers');\n  if(rows.some(r=>r.length!==headers.length))reject('row_width');\n  return {headers,rows};\n}\n\nfunction inspectImageUrl(value){\n  const input=String(value??'');\n  if(/[\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]/.test(input))return 'invalid';\n  const raw=input.trim();\n  if(!raw)return 'missing';\n  if(raw.length>8192||/[\\x00-\\x20\\x7f]/.test(raw))return 'invalid';\n  try{\n    const u=new URL(raw),h=u.hostname.toLowerCase();\n    if(u.protocol!=='https:'||u.username||u.password||u.port||u.hash)return 'rejected';\n    // Syntactic validation only, not DNS resolution or permission to fetch.\n    if(!/^(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?\\.)+[a-z]{2,63}$/.test(h)||h==='localhost'||/\\.(?:localhost|local|internal|test|invalid)$/.test(h))return 'rejected';\n    return 'https_url_present';\n  }catch{return 'invalid';}\n}\n\nfunction previewCsvSample(buffer,{idColumn,imageColumns,referenceBuffer,referenceIdColumn}={}){\n  const csv=parseCsvSample(buffer);\n  if(typeof idColumn!=='string'||!csv.headers.includes(idColumn))reject('id_column');\n  if(!Array.isArray(imageColumns)||!imageColumns.length||new Set(imageColumns).size!==imageColumns.length||imageColumns.some(c=>!csv.headers.includes(c)||c===idColumn))reject('image_columns');\n  let references;\n  if(referenceBuffer!==undefined){\n    const ref=parseCsvSample(referenceBuffer);const index=ref.headers.indexOf(referenceIdColumn);\n    if(index<0)reject('reference_id_column');\n    references=new Map();for(const row of ref.rows){const id=row[index];if(!id.trim())reject('reference_id');references.set(id,(references.get(id)||0)+1);}\n  }\n  const idIndex=csv.headers.indexOf(idColumn),imageIndices=imageColumns.map(c=>csv.headers.indexOf(c));\n  const counts=new Map();for(const row of csv.rows){const id=row[idIndex];if(id.trim())counts.set(id,(counts.get(id)||0)+1);}\n  // Return row numbers and statuses only: no SKUs, signed URLs, prices or other cells.\n  const sample=csv.rows.map((row,i)=>{\n    const id=row[idIndex];\n    const matching=!id.trim()?'missing_id':counts.get(id)>1?'duplicate_sample_id':!references?'not_checked':(references.get(id)||0)>1?'ambiguous_reference_id':references.has(id)?'exact_match':'no_exact_match';\n    return {record:i+1,matching,images:imageIndices.map(index=>inspectImageUrl(row[index]))};\n  });\n  return {read_only:true,database_writes:0,network_requests:0,records:sample.length,column_count:csv.headers.length,\n    matching_rule:'Exact case-sensitive strings; no coercion, trimming, UPC inference or fuzzy matching.',\n    image_accessibility:'Not checked. HTTPS syntax alone does not prove the image is accessible.',sample};\n}\n\nconst CSV_SAMPLE_LIMITS=limits;\n\n\nconst categories=['Music','Electronics','Cameras','Watches','Outdoor gear','Books'];\nconst items=[['Acoustic guitar','Music','guitar','Juniper'],['Studio headphones','Electronics','headphones','Northstar'],['Mirrorless camera','Cameras','camera','Frame & Co.'],['Everyday field watch','Watches','watch','Atlas'],['Weekend backpack','Outdoor gear','bag','Fieldnote'],['Portable speaker','Electronics','speaker','Northstar'],['Design bookshelf collection','Books','books','Paperhouse'],['Compact keyboard','Music','keyboard','Juniper'],['Over-ear headphones','Electronics','headphones','Northstar'],['Travel camera','Cameras','camera','Frame & Co.'],['Canvas daypack','Outdoor gear','bag','Fieldnote'],['Quartz wristwatch','Watches','watch','Atlas'],['Travel photography books','Books','books','Paperhouse'],['Bluetooth desk speaker','Electronics','speaker','Northstar'],['Travel acoustic guitar','Music','guitar','Juniper'],['Mechanical keyboard','Electronics','keyboard','Northstar'],['Digital compact camera','Cameras','camera','Frame & Co.'],['Classic watch','Watches','watch','Atlas'],['Trail backpack','Outdoor gear','bag','Fieldnote'],['Architecture book set','Books','books','Paperhouse'],['Practice keyboard','Music','keyboard','Juniper'],['Mini wireless speaker','Electronics','speaker','Northstar'],['Recording headphones','Music','headphones','Juniper'],['Daily carry bag','Outdoor gear','bag','Fieldnote']];\nconst demoItems=items.map(([name,category,art,brand],i)=>({uid:'demo-'+i,name,category,brand,sku:i===11?'DEMO-011':i===22?'':'DEMO-'+String(i+1).padStart(3,'0'),quantity:i%6===0?0:(i*7%29)+1,images:i%5===0?[]:[`assets/${art}.svg`,...(i%3===1?[`assets/${art}-detail.svg`]:[])],description:'Synthetic demonstration merchandise for reviewing the inventory workspace. This record does not represent an item in the live store.',condition:['Good','Very good','Like new'][i%3],source:'Synthetic demonstration',location:['Display cabinet','Stockroom shelf','Front counter'][i%3]}));\nfunction qualityWarnings(item,all=demoItems){const warnings=[];if(!item.sku.trim())warnings.push('Identifier is missing');if(item.sku&&all.filter(x=>x.sku===item.sku).length>1)warnings.push('Identifier is repeated; records retained');if(!item.images.length)warnings.push('No image attached');if(!item.name.trim())warnings.push('Item name is missing');return warnings;}\nfunction selectItems(items,{query='',category='',stock='',image='',sort='name',direction=1,page=1,pageSize=8}={}){\n const q=query.trim().toLocaleLowerCase();const filtered=items.filter(x=>(!q||[x.name,x.sku,x.brand].some(v=>v.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(q)))&&(!category||x.category===category)&&(!stock||(stock==='in'?x.quantity>0:x.quantity===0))&&(!image||(image==='present'?x.images.length>0:x.images.length===0)));\n filtered.sort((a,b)=>direction*(typeof a[sort]==='number'?a[sort]-b[sort]:String(a[sort]).localeCompare(String(b[sort])))||a.uid.localeCompare(b.uid));\n const pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(filtered.length/pageSize)),current=Math.max(1,Math.min(page,pages));return {items:filtered.slice((current-1)*pageSize,current*pageSize),total:filtered.length,page:current,pages};\n}\nconst approvedHosts=new Set(['images.unsplash.com','images.pexels.com']);\nfunction imageSource(value){\n if(!value)return {status:'missing'};\n if(/^assets\\/[a-z-]+\\.svg$/.test(value))return {status:'local',url:typeof workspaceAssets==='undefined'?value:workspaceAssets[value]};\n if(/[\\x00-\\x20\\x7f]/.test(value))return {status:'invalid'};\n try{const u=new URL(value);if(u.protocol!=='https:'||u.username||u.password||u.port||u.hash)return {status:'invalid'};if(!approvedHosts.has(u.hostname))return {status:'host_review'};return {status:'external',url:u.href,host:u.hostname};}catch{return {status:'invalid'};}\n}\nfunction decodeSample(bytes,encoding='utf-8'){\n if(bytes.byteLength>CSV_SAMPLE_LIMITS.bytes)throw Error('This file exceeds the 1 MiB preview limit. Choose a small, complete sample.');\n if(!['utf-8','windows-1252'].includes(encoding))throw Error('Choose a supported text encoding.');\n let text;try{text=new TextDecoder(encoding,{fatal:true}).decode(bytes);}catch{throw Error('The file does not match the selected encoding. Try the exporter’s documented encoding.');}\n return parseCsvSample(new TextEncoder().encode(text));\n}\nfunction validateMapped(csv,{idColumn,nameColumn,imageColumn=''}){\n const id=csv.headers.indexOf(idColumn),name=csv.headers.indexOf(nameColumn),image=csv.headers.indexOf(imageColumn);\n if(id<0||name<0||id===name)throw Error('Map separate identifier and name columns.');\n const counts=new Map();for(const r of csv.rows)if(r[id].trim())counts.set(r[id],(counts.get(r[id])||0)+1);\n const rows=csv.rows.map((r,i)=>({record:i+1,id:r[id],name:r[name],issues:[...(!r[id].trim()?['Missing identifier']:[]),...(!r[name].trim()?['Missing name']:[]),...(counts.get(r[id])>1?['Repeated identifier']:[]),...(image>=0&&!['local','external','missing'].includes(imageSource(r[image]).status)?['Image URL needs review']:[])],image:image<0?'not_mapped':imageSource(r[image]).status}));\n return {records:rows.length,repeatedGroups:[...counts.values()].filter(n=>n>1).length,missing:rows.filter(r=>r.issues.some(i=>i.startsWith('Missing'))).length,attention:rows.filter(r=>r.issues.length).length,rows};\n}\n\n\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]));\nconst state={query:'',category:'',stock:'',image:'',sort:'name',direction:1,page:1,pageSize:8};let csv=null,fileName='',history=[],lastFocus=null,fileGeneration=0;\nconst views={overview:['Inventory overview','A clear view of your merchandise and the details that need attention.'],inventory:['Merchandise inventory','Search, sort, and inspect your demonstration merchandise.'],imports:['CSV inspection','Understand your data before it enters an inventory system.'],images:['Image library','Review available images and identify missing details.'],quality:['Data quality','Catch incomplete or repeated information without changing a record.']};\nfunction navigate(view){if(!views[view])return;document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.view===view));$('pageTitle').textContent=views[view][0];$('pageSubtitle').textContent=views[view][1];$('summary').hidden=!['overview','inventory'].includes(view);for(const [id,key] of [['catalogSection','inventory'],['importsSection','imports'],['imagesSection','images'],['qualitySection','quality']])$(id).hidden=key==='inventory'?!['overview','inventory'].includes(view):view!==key;$('sidebar').classList.remove('open');$('menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>navigate(b.dataset.view)));$('inspectTop').onclick=()=>navigate('imports');$('menu').onclick=()=>{const open=$('sidebar').classList.toggle('open');$('menu').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));};\nconst withImages=demoItems.filter(x=>x.images.length).length,attention=demoItems.filter(x=>qualityWarnings(x).length).length;\n$('navCount').textContent=demoItems.length;$('activityCount').textContent=`${demoItems.length} non-weapon sample records · six categories`;\n$('summary').innerHTML=[['Total items',demoItems.length,'Across six sample categories','▦'],['In stock',demoItems.filter(x=>x.quantity>0).length,'Snapshot quantities · demo data','◫'],['Images available',withImages,`${demoItems.length-withImages} items need an image`,'▧'],['Need attention',attention,'Missing images or identifiers','◇']].map(([name,value,note,icon])=>`<article class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metricTop\"><span>${name}</span><span class=\"metricIcon\">${icon}</span></div><strong>${value}</strong><small>${note}</small></article>`).join('');\n$('category').innerHTML+=[...categories].sort().map(c=>`<option>${esc(c)}</option>`).join('');$('imagePercent').textContent=Math.round(withImages/demoItems.length*100)+'%';$('imageProgress').style.width=withImages/demoItems.length*100+'%';$('imageNote').textContent=`${withImages} of ${demoItems.length} sample items have an illustration attached.`;\nfunction thumbnail(item){return item.images.length?`<img class=\"thumb\" src=\"${esc(imageSource(item.images[0]).url)}\" alt=\"${esc(item.name)} illustration\" loading=\"lazy\">`:'<span class=\"thumb missingThumb\" aria-label=\"No image attached\">▧</span>';}\nfunction render(){const result=selectItems(demoItems,state);state.page=result.page;$('rows').innerHTML=result.items.map(x=>`<tr><td><div class=\"productCell\">${thumbnail(x)}<div><div class=\"productName\">${esc(x.name)}</div><div class=\"productBrand\">${esc(x.brand)}</div></div></div></td><td class=\"idCell\">${esc(x.sku||'Not provided')}</td><td>${esc(x.category)}</td><td class=\"stockCell\">${x.quantity}<small>${x.quantity?'In stock':'Out of stock'}</small></td><td><span class=\"tag ${x.images.length?'neutral':'warning'}\">${x.images.length?'● Available':'○ Missing'}</span></td><td><span class=\"tag ${qualityWarnings(x).length?'warning':'good'}\">${qualityWarnings(x).length?'◇ Review':'✓ Complete'}</span></td><td><button class=\"viewButton\" data-detail=\"${x.uid}\" aria-label=\"View ${esc(x.name)}\">↗</button></td></tr>`).join('');$('empty').hidden=Boolean(result.total);$('results').textContent=result.total?`Showing ${(state.page-1)*state.pageSize+1}–${Math.min(state.page*state.pageSize,result.total)} of ${result.total} items`:'0 matching items';$('pageNumber').textContent=`${state.page} / ${result.pages}`;$('previous').disabled=state.page===1;$('next').disabled=state.page===result.pages;document.querySelectorAll('th button').forEach(b=>{b.parentElement.setAttribute('aria-sort',state.sort===b.dataset.sort?(state.direction===1?'ascending':'descending'):'none');b.querySelector('span').textContent=state.sort===b.dataset.sort?(state.direction===1?'↑':'↓'):'↕';});$('rows').querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>showDetails(b.dataset.detail));$('rows').querySelectorAll('img').forEach(img=>img.addEventListener('error',()=>{img.replaceWith(Object.assign(document.createElement('span'),{className:'thumb missingThumb',textContent:'▧',ariaLabel:'Image could not load'}));}));}\nfunction clear(){Object.assign(state,{query:'',category:'',stock:'',image:'',page:1});for(const id of ['search','category','stock','imageFilter'])$(id).value='';render();}\n$('clear').onclick=clear;$('emptyClear').onclick=clear;$('search').oninput=e=>{state.query=e.target.value;state.page=1;render();};for(const [id,key] of [['category','category'],['stock','stock'],['imageFilter','image']])$(id).onchange=e=>{state[key]=e.target.value;state.page=1;render();};$('pageSize').onchange=e=>{state.pageSize=Number(e.target.value);state.page=1;render();};$('next').onclick=()=>{state.page++;render();};$('previous').onclick=()=>{state.page--;render();};document.querySelectorAll('[data-sort]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.direction=state.sort===b.dataset.sort?-state.direction:1;state.sort=b.dataset.sort;render();});\nfunction closeDetail(){$('detail').hidden=true;$('overlay').hidden=true;document.body.style.overflow='';lastFocus?.focus();}\n$('closeDetail').onclick=closeDetail;$('overlay').onclick=closeDetail;\n$('detail').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeDetail();if(e.key==='Tab'){const focus=[...$('detail').querySelectorAll('button:not([disabled]),a,input,select')].filter(x=>x.getClientRects().length);const first=focus[0],last=focus.at(-1);if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last.focus();}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first.focus();}}});\nfunction showDetails(uid){const x=demoItems.find(x=>x.uid===uid);if(!x)return;lastFocus=document.activeElement;const warnings=qualityWarnings(x);$('detailTitle').textContent=x.name;$('detailBody').innerHTML=`<div class=\"detailContent\"><div id=\"galleryHero\"></div><div class=\"galleryThumbs\" id=\"galleryThumbs\"></div><span class=\"tag ${warnings.length?'warning':'good'}\">${warnings.length?'Needs attention':'Complete record'}</span><div class=\"detailGrid\"><div><small>Identifier</small>${esc(x.sku||'Not provided')}</div><div><small>Category</small>${esc(x.category)}</div><div><small>Quantity · sample snapshot</small>${x.quantity}</div><div><small>Condition</small>${esc(x.condition)}</div><div><small>Brand</small>${esc(x.brand)}</div><div><small>Sample location</small>${esc(x.location)}</div></div><section class=\"detailBlock\"><h3>Description</h3><p>${esc(x.description)}</p></section><section class=\"detailBlock\"><h3>Image review</h3><p>${x.images.length?`${x.images.length} local sample illustration(s). External URLs require an approved host and an explicit load action.`:'No image is attached. The placeholder is intentional; no image URL has been invented.'}</p></section>${warnings.map(w=>`<div class=\"warningBox\">◇ ${esc(w)}</div>`).join('')}<div class=\"sourceBox\"><b>Data source</b><p>${esc(x.source)} · loaded this session<br>No API connection. No import, edits or store inventory writes.</p></div></div>`;renderHero(x.images[0],x.name);$('galleryThumbs').innerHTML=x.images.map((url,i)=>`<button data-gallery=\"${i}\" aria-label=\"View image ${i+1}\"><img src=\"${esc(imageSource(url).url)}\" alt=\"Sample image ${i+1}\"></button>`).join('');$('galleryThumbs').querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>renderHero(x.images[Number(b.dataset.gallery)],x.name));$('detail').hidden=false;$('overlay').hidden=false;document.body.style.overflow='hidden';$('closeDetail').focus();}\nfunction renderHero(url,name,area=$('galleryHero')){const source=imageSource(url);area.replaceChildren();const placeholder=(message)=>{const box=document.createElement('div');box.className='heroMissing';const inner=document.createElement('div'),icon=document.createElement('b');icon.textContent='▧';inner.append(icon,document.createTextNode(message));box.append(inner);area.replaceChildren(box);};if(source.status==='missing'){placeholder('No image attached');return;}if(['invalid','host_review'].includes(source.status)){placeholder('Image URL needs review');return;}const load=()=>{const img=document.createElement('img');img.className='heroImage';img.alt=name+' illustration';img.referrerPolicy='no-referrer';if(source.status==='external')img.crossOrigin='anonymous';img.onload=()=>img.dataset.loaded='true';img.onerror=()=>placeholder('Image could not load. The original URL was kept unchanged.');img.src=source.url;area.replaceChildren(img);};if(source.status==='local')load();else{placeholder(`External image from ${source.host}`);const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent='Load approved external image';b.className='secondary';b.onclick=load;area.append(b);}}\n$('imageGrid').innerHTML=demoItems.map(x=>`<article class=\"imageCard\">${x.images.length?`<img src=\"${esc(imageSource(x.images[0]).url)}\" alt=\"${esc(x.name)} illustration\" loading=\"lazy\">`:'<div class=\"missingThumb\" aria-label=\"No image\">▧</div>'}<h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><span class=\"tag ${x.images.length?'neutral':'warning'}\">${x.images.length?'Local illustration':'Missing image'}</span><button data-detail=\"${x.uid}\">View details</button></article>`).join('');$('imageGrid').querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>showDetails(b.dataset.detail));\n$('qualityList').innerHTML=demoItems.filter(x=>qualityWarnings(x).length).map(x=>`<article class=\"qualityRow\"><span>◇</span><div><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><p>${qualityWarnings(x).map(esc).join(' · ')}</p></div><button data-detail=\"${x.uid}\">Review details →</button></article>`).join('');$('qualityList').querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>showDetails(b.dataset.detail));\nfunction resetInspection(){csv=null;$('mapping').hidden=true;$('mappingEmpty').hidden=false;$('csvPreview').replaceChildren();$('validationTag').textContent='AWAITING VALIDATION';$('validationResult').innerHTML='<p class=\"muted\">Choose columns and validate to see a fresh report.</p>';}\nfunction populateMapping(parsed,name){csv=parsed;fileName=name;const options=parsed.headers.map(h=>`<option value=\"${esc(h)}\">${esc(h)}</option>`).join('');$('mapId').innerHTML='<option value=\"\">Select identifier column</option>'+options;$('mapName').innerHTML='<option value=\"\">Select name column</option>'+options;$('mapImage').innerHTML='<option value=\"\">Do not map an image</option>'+options;if(name==='Synthetic inspection sample'){$('mapId').value='Identifier';$('mapName').value='Name';}$('mapping').hidden=false;$('mappingEmpty').hidden=true;$('fileStatus').className='fileStatus';$('fileStatus').textContent=`${name} · ${parsed.rows.length} records · ${parsed.headers.length} columns. Original file unchanged.`;}\nasync function inspectFile(){const generation=++fileGeneration;resetInspection();const file=$('csvFile').files?.[0];if(!file){$('fileStatus').textContent='No file selected.';return;}$('fileStatus').className='fileStatus';$('fileStatus').textContent='Inspecting file…';$('validate').disabled=true;try{if(file.size>1024*1024)throw Error(`This file is ${(file.size/1024/1024).toFixed(1)} MiB. Preview limit: 1 MiB and 200 complete records. Choose a small sample; the original file remains untouched.`);const buffer=new Uint8Array(await file.arrayBuffer());if(generation!==fileGeneration)return;populateMapping(decodeSample(buffer,$('encoding').value),file.name);}catch(e){if(generation!==fileGeneration)return;$('fileStatus').className='fileStatus error';$('fileStatus').textContent=e.message?.startsWith('CSV preview rejected:')?'CSV structure could not be read. Check quoting, headers, record sizes and the selected encoding.':e.message;}finally{if(generation===fileGeneration)$('validate').disabled=false;}}\n$('csvFile').onchange=inspectFile;$('encoding').onchange=()=>{if($('csvFile').files?.length)inspectFile();};$('sampleCsv').onclick=()=>{fileGeneration++;resetInspection();$('csvFile').value='';populateMapping(decodeSample(new TextEncoder().encode('Identifier,Name,Image\\r\\nDEMO-A,Sample headphones,\\r\\nDEMO-B,Sample daypack,\\r\\nDEMO-B,Sample watch,\\r\\n,Sample notebook,\\r\\n')),'Synthetic inspection sample');};\n$('validate').onclick=()=>{if(!csv)return;try{const report=validateMapped(csv,{idColumn:$('mapId').value,nameColumn:$('mapName').value,imageColumn:$('mapImage').value});$('validationTag').textContent=report.attention?'REVIEW NEEDED':'CHECKS PASSED';$('validationTag').className='tag '+(report.attention?'warning':'good');$('validationResult').className='';$('validationResult').innerHTML=`<div class=\"resultStats\"><div><strong>${report.records}</strong><small>Records inspected</small></div><div><strong>${report.repeatedGroups}</strong><small>Repeated ID groups</small></div><div><strong>${report.missing}</strong><small>Incomplete records</small></div><div><strong>${report.attention}</strong><small>Need attention</small></div></div><p class=\"muted\">All original rows retained. Image URLs are not fetched or checked for accessibility.</p>`;$('csvPreview').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>RECORD</th><th>IDENTIFIER</th><th>NAME</th><th>VALIDATION</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+report.rows.slice(0,10).map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.record}</td><td>${esc(r.id||'Missing')}</td><td>${esc(r.name||'Missing')}</td><td>${esc(r.issues.join(' · ')||'Complete')}</td></tr>`).join('')+'</tbody></table>';history.unshift({name:fileName,records:report.records,time:new Date().toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}),attention:report.attention});history=history.slice(0,8);$('history').innerHTML=history.map(h=>`<div class=\"historyRow\"><span class=\"tag ${h.attention?'warning':'good'}\">${h.attention?'REVIEW':'CHECKED'}</span><div><b>${esc(h.name)}</b><p>${h.records} records · preview only</p></div><small>${esc(h.time)}</small></div>`).join('');}catch(e){$('validationTag').textContent='MAPPING NEEDED';$('validationResult').textContent=e.message;}};\nrender();\n\nfor(const id of ['mapId','mapName','mapImage'])$(id).addEventListener('change',()=>{$('validationTag').textContent='AWAITING VALIDATION';$('validationTag').className='tag neutral';$('validationResult').textContent='Column mapping changed. Validate again to refresh the report.';$('csvPreview').replaceChildren();});\n$('previewImage').onclick=()=>renderHero($('imageUrl').value,'External image preview',$('externalImagePreview'));\n</script></body></html>\n"
